 inside a patriarchy?\n\nThis is not a lecture. It is a structured conversa
 tion about power\, equality\, family\, sex\, law\, care\, violence\, democ
 racy\, and what kind of world we want to build.\n\nThis event welcomes ope
 n inquiry and diverse viewpoints within a foundation of equality\, human d
